      ":question/id": "aca9b560-7fb1-5d32-911b-353d7ce59291",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices are lower triangular matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The matrix $A$ is a lower triangular matrix since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrices $B$ and $C$ are *not* lower triangular matrices since they each have a non-zero element above the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{12} & =11\\ne 0 \\\\ {c}_{13} & =3\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
